  "system": {
    "slug": "james-vega",
    "details": {
      "level": {
        "value": 7
      },
      "publicNotes": "<p>Lieutenant James Vega is a decorated Alliance marine who serves aboard the Normandy SR-2. He is massive, physically powerful, and surprisingly thoughtful beneath the bravado. Vega fights in close quarters with a heavy assault rifle and a combat knife, preferring to close the distance and overwhelm enemies before they can react.</p><p><strong>Soldier's Endurance (1/encounter):</strong> When Vega would take a critical hit, he may treat it as a normal hit instead.</p><p><strong>Kinetic Barrier:</strong> 40 Shield HP. Recharges 12 HP per turn.</p>",
      "privateNotes": "",
